{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11115240","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11115240","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1111524001:0":{"text":"为什么只有你们几个回来了？你们找到宝藏了？","source_cn":"为什么只有你们几个回来了？你们找到宝藏了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD46C851DD5485E2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111524002:0":{"text":"阿爸呢……没有阿爸。请问，你们有没有见过我的阿爸？","source_cn":"阿爸呢……没有阿爸。请问，你们有没有见过我的阿爸？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15339F13AFD3FE20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111524003:0":{"text":"他叫阿米！他很喜欢讲故事，也很喜欢写日记。","source_cn":"他叫阿米！他很喜欢讲故事，也很喜欢写日记。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B5DCC2EF22F256C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111524004:0":{"text":"他说他会把寻宝途中各种有趣的事情都记下来，回来后讲给我听……","source_cn":"他说他会把寻宝途中各种有趣的事情都记下来，回来后讲给我听……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C1E390C1F9D1A5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111524005:0":{"text":"有谁见过吗？有谁……见过他吗？他是我的阿爸……","source_cn":"有谁见过吗？有谁……见过他吗？他是我的阿爸……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1829874E04E44862","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"",